    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt feel like a \"moment of rest\" can fix it though. it's not just being tired, it's the way she looks at me sometimes. like she's just tired of me. i can see the resentment in her eyes every time she has to help me with something basic. i feel like i've just become this permanent obstacle in her life. it feels more like a kindness to everyone if i just wasn't here to cause all this trouble.",
